    November vote. Any debt payments would begin in FY27 at the earliest.
- time: 00:42:29
  seconds: 2549
  topic: Budget Review Timeline
  desc: The Superintendent reiterated the upcoming budget workshops and the timeline
    for city council review and voter approval in June. He noted that the school board
    and city council each have distinct lenses for reviewing the budget.
- time: 00:43:13
  seconds: 2593
  topic: Board Questions and Clarifications
  desc: Board members posed clarifying questions regarding the budget presentation.
