    are important, it is the staff who educate students, and the board must 'own'
    the budget and advocate for the kids.
- time: 01:48:14
  seconds: 6494
  topic: Lack of Transparency & Arbitrary Cuts (Giselle Lopez)
  desc: Giselle Lopez, a parent, criticized the lack of communication and transparency
